sequenceDiagram
    title Checkout flow
    box Aqua Frontend
        participant W as Web
        actor U as User
    end
    box rgb(255, 230, 200) Backend services
        participant API
        participant DB
    end
    participant Ext as External
    U->>W: click buy
    W->>API: POST /orders
    API->>DB: insert
    DB-->>API: ok
    API->>Ext: charge
    Ext-->>API: paid
    API-->>W: 201
